      "scale": "0 unusable; 5 functional with substantial friction; 7 good with noticeable limitations; 9 excellent with minor friction; 10 exceptional. Subjective scores for observed emulated mobile interaction only, not derived from wins, accuracy or score; overall is holistic, not an arithmetic average.",
      "overallMobile": 7.2,
      "controls": {
        "score": 7.0,
        "reason": "Large labeled controls, simultaneous MOVE/FIRE drag and visible scene turn worked; tap aiming helped correct failed manual patrol targeting. Continuous rearming, ergonomics and physical precision remain unassessed."
      },
      "gameplay": {
        "score": 7.0,
        "reason": "Clear recover/coils/upload progression and useful feedback; patrol engagement and armor timing provided observed challenges. Most travel/recovery was assisted, limiting assessment of free navigation, depth and sustained combat."
      },
      "presentation": {
        "score": 8.0,
        "reason": "Cohesive rainy teal industrial atmosphere, distinctive relay and orderly results screen; scene geometry remains fairly spare and blocky."
      },
      "usability": {
        "score": 7.5,
        "reason": "Explicit tutorial, route/approach labels, map and fresh-start result flow were understandable. Dense simultaneous warnings compete for attention."
      },
      "readability": {
        "score": 6.5,
        "reason": "Health, ammo, mission labels and terminal stats are clear. Distant enemies, small phase text, fine signage and map legend strain the compact landscape view."
      }
    },
